<block wx:if="{{authorized}}"><view wx:if="{{simulatorPreview}}" class="notice">商家本地预览 · 未验证身份 · 仅本机演示数据</view>
<view class="page edit-page"><view class="eyebrow">A LITTLE DETAIL, A BETTER MENU</view><view class="page-title">{{isNew ? '添一道好菜。' : '打磨这道好味。'}}</view><view class="subtitle">保存后，顾客端重新进入菜单即可看到更新。</view><view class="image-editor" bindtap="chooseImage"><image src="{{image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="image-caption">点击更换菜品图片 ↗</view></view><view class="notice">图片仅保存在当前设备；Demo 使用 AI 生成菜单图。</view>
<view class="field-label">菜品名称 <text class="danger">*</text></view><input class="input" maxlength="24" data-field="name" value="{{name}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：炭烤羊肉串"/>
<view class="field-label">所属分区 <text class="danger">*</text></view><picker range="{{categories}}" range-key="name" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="category"><view class="input row between"><text>{{categories[categoryIndex].name || '请先创建分区'}}</text><text class="muted">⌄</text></view></picker>
<view class="row edit-price-row"><view><view class="field-label">价格（元） <text class="danger">*</text></view><input class="input" type="digit" maxlength="8" data-field="price" value="{{price}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="0.00"/></view><view><view class="field-label">单位 <text class="danger">*</text></view><input class="input" maxlength="6" data-field="unit" value="{{unit}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="串 / 份 / 杯"/></view></view>
<view class="field-label">菜品描述</view><textarea class="input textarea" maxlength="80" data-field="description" value="{{description}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="写一点食材、风味或推荐吃法"/>
<view class="field-label">推荐标签</view><input class="input" maxlength="8" data-field="tag" value="{{tag}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：招牌必点（可不填）"/>
<view class="card"><view class="setting-line row between"><view><view>可选择辣度</view><view class="subtitle">不辣、微辣、中辣、特辣</view></view><switch color="#b74b32" checked="{{spicy}}" data-field="spicy" bindchange="toggle"/></view><view class="divider"/><view class="setting-line row between"><view><view>上架销售</view><view class="subtitle">关闭后顾客菜单中隐藏</view></view><switch color="#b74b32" checked="{{onSale}}" data-field="onSale" bindchange="toggle"/></view><view class="divider"/><view class="setting-line row between"><view><view>临时售罄</view><view class="subtitle">展示菜品，但暂停点单</view></view><switch color="#b74b32" checked="{{soldOut}}" data-field="soldOut" bindchange="toggle"/></view></view>
<button class="primary" style="margin-top:30rpx" bindtap="save">保存菜品</button><button wx:if="{{!isNew}}" class="delete-dish" bindtap="delete">删除菜品</button></view>

</block>
